            2 $CellContext`\[Gamma]$$ \
$CellContext`\[Omega]$^2)/(($CellContext`\[Omega]0^2 - \
$CellContext`\[Omega]$^2)^2 + (
             2 $CellContext`\[Gamma]$$ $CellContext`\[Omega]$)^2)); Grid[{{
